| Spike 3b driver: does the bridge's listener hear Lua crash text? /delay is in tenths of a second.
Sub Main
    /lua run spike3b_listener
    /delay 10
    | 1: crash in the main chunk
    /lua run spike3b_crash_main
    /delay 40
    | 2: crash inside an mq.event handler
    /lua run spike3b_crash_event
    /delay 10
    /echo SPIKE3B-TRIGGER
    /delay 50
    | 3: crash inside an mq.bind handler
    /lua run spike3b_crash_bind
    /delay 10
    /spike3bbind
    /delay 50
    /lua stop spike3b_listener
/return
